Package: gettoken-token-service
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}@DEPENDS@:gettoken-token-service
Description: token broker for AI agents - answers a request for a token
 token-service authenticates a request, resolves what it asks for, and hands
 who is asking and what for to the exchanger. What the exchanger answers is
 checked against the contract before it is handed back.
